# Work material that is not part of the software.
#
# The specification, plans, baselines, decision records and evidence bundles live beside this
# checkout and are written for whoever is working on the app, not for the people reading the
# repository. This repository publishes the app itself: sources, build files, scripts and tests.
# Nothing under docs/ is tracked, and this line is what keeps a future `git add` from putting it
# back.
docs/

